WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.320
In Ibiza, the clock puts you on the road. Not your power, and not your cadence.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:14.871
Each segment of the plan has its own stretch of road, ridden evenly over the

00:00:14.871 --> 00:00:20.076
segment. Three minutes five puts you twelve hundred and four metres from the grid.

00:00:25.809 --> 00:00:30.354
The bike reported nothing for thirty seconds, and the rider was two hundred metres

00:00:30.354 --> 00:00:35.310
up the road. Sprinting at a hundred and twenty moved them no further than the clock.

00:00:41.295 --> 00:00:46.456
On the grid the camera sits closer. It eases back over forty-five metres, and closes

00:00:46.456 --> 00:00:48.169
in again at the finish.

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:56.597
Pause, and the rider holds their place: ten seconds later, the same metre. A lost

00:00:56.597 --> 00:01:01.016
bike holds them too, and the ride carries on from where it stopped.

00:01:07.104 --> 00:01:12.015
Hide the tab and no frame is drawn. Show it again, and the rider is where the clock

00:01:12.015 --> 00:01:12.493
is.

00:01:17.428 --> 00:01:22.678
Everything else is as with the class video. The same telemetry gives the same output

00:01:22.678 --> 00:01:24.790
and the same share on target.

00:01:27.751 --> 00:01:30.426
The first effort, from a phone to a desktop.

00:01:38.075 --> 00:01:43.196
The code carried over already met every criterion, so each spec was proved by taking

00:01:43.196 --> 00:01:48.135
its rule away. Three hundred and thirty-four specs and six hundred and twenty-one

00:01:48.135 --> 00:01:49.410
unit tests pass.

00:01:53.561 --> 00:01:59.215
Telo Ride 1, from the Telo family, is the focused edition of Telo Ride: one class,

00:01:59.215 --> 00:02:00.411
nothing else.

00:02:00.756 --> 00:02:05.708
It pairs with a smart bike at home over Bluetooth, plays the class video, or draws

00:02:05.708 --> 00:02:10.720
the Ibiza Sunset Strip course to music if the rider chooses it, and sets the bike's

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:14.221
resistance for every interval while the rider pedals.

00:02:14.566 --> 00:02:18.542
Connect the bike, take the class, see your number, and come back to beat it.
